// Title: Dism Remove Online Package
// Rule ID: 43e32da2-fdd0-4156-90de-50dfd62636f9
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1562.001
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_dism_remove.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
